 its own terms. And taking it seriously does not require pretending Guardiola cannot coach. His teams played extraordinary football. Klopp respected him. I can respect the work on the pitch and still demand accountability for how a club operates. Those two things belong in the same conversation.", "voice_id": "bu5eKETbFKC8G702EAU4", "model_id": "eleven_multilingual_v2"}